WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.330 --> 00:00:04.560
The United States of America and the world&nbsp;
listened as President Lyndon B. Johnson&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:09.783
addressed a Joint Session of Congress. "I am&nbsp;
here today, 

00:00:09.783 --> 00:00:16.152
to say I need your help.

00:00:16.152 --> 00:00:21.791
I cannot bear this burden alone. I need the&nbsp;
help

00:00:21.791 --> 00:00:40.007
of all Americans in all America

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:49.840
John Kennedy's death commands what his life&nbsp;
conveys, that America must move forward."

